<title>CHINA: China, Asia Minerals in $75 mln gold mine.</title>
<headline>China, Asia Minerals in $75 mln gold mine.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's Zhaoyuan Gold Industrial Group and Asia Minerals Corp have signed a contract to set up China's first gold mining joint venture, company officials said on Monday.</p>
</text>
